              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mercenary Crossbowmen: Hand weapon and crossbow. May have heavy armour (+3) and pavise (+2). May exchange crossbow for light crossbow (-2) but then may not take any other equipment options. Mercenary Knights: Hand weapon, lance partial plate armour, shield, and warhorse. May give warhorse cloth barding (+3). Shock Cavalry. First Charge. Veteran, Unreliable.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="d16b-97cb-a794-5cc7" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">None</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
